# Apex: Apex Developer Guide (Salesforce): reserved keywords, data types, annotations; requirements/languages/apex.md
name     apex cls-apex trigger

keyword  abstract break catch class continue do else enum extends final finally for global if implements
keyword  instanceof interface new override private protected public return static super switch on this
keyword  throw trigger try virtual while with without sharing inherited insert update delete upsert merge
keyword  undelete select from where order by limit and or not testmethod webservice transient
type     Integer Long Double Decimal String Boolean Id Date Datetime Time Blob Object List Set Map sObject
type     void
builtin  true false null System Database Schema
fold-case

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   ' '  : escapes
escape        : u4
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~
calls
